に残ってるのは、どれどれ…一匹だけ…いったいどうすれば…","nextNodeIds":[751240102]},{"nodeId":751240102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"ジョンヴェル","textMapHash":2745574882,"text":"時間がかかりそうですね…","nextNodeIds":[751240103]},{"nodeId":751240103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3681725578,"text":"おっ、写真を撮ってるやつがいるぞ…撮ってるのは浮流ペンギンか？","nextNodeIds":[751240104]},{"nodeId":751240104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4200193626,"text":"浮流ペンギンってかわいいよな…","nextNodeIds":[751240105,751240107]},{"nodeId":751240105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2811780378,"text":"よちよち歩く姿が可愛い…","nextNodeIds":[751240106]},{"nodeId":751240106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2063964290,"text":"だな。よちよち歩きもかわいいし、体を膨らませて、まん丸になって水面に浮かんでる姿も見てるだけで癒されるぞ。","nextNodeIds":[751240109]},{"nodeId":751240109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"ジョンヴェル","textMapHash":2600045178,"text":"つやつや銀髪の小さなレディーの仰る通りです！浮流ペンギンという生物を創造したものは、この世で最も讃えられるべきでしょう…","nextNodeIds":[751240110]},{"nodeId":751240110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"ジョンヴェル","textMapHash":3560626946,"text":"本当に偉大です…あっ、すみません、自己紹介が遅れました。私はジョンヴェル、浮流ペンギンの写真愛好家です。ジョンヴェルとお呼びください。","nextNodeIds":[751240111]},{"nodeId":751240111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2934740090,"text":"#おう、オイラはパイモン、こいつは{NICKNAME}だ。…浮流ペンギンがこんなにたくさんいるのに、なんでおまえはため息ばかりついてるんだ？","nextNodeIds":[751240112]},{"nodeId":751240112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"ジョンヴェル","textMapHash":995513506,"text":"話すと長くなるのですが…簡単にお伝えしますね。浮流ペンギンの写真愛好家はたくさんいます。そして誰もがより面白い写真を撮りたいと考えているんです…","nextNodeIds":[751240113]},{"nodeId":751240113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"ジョンヴェル","textMapHash":3171772042,"text":"もちろん私もです。数日前、奇抜なアイデアが浮かんできました——浮流ペンギンを浮き輪で囲んで写真を撮る、というものです！","nextNodeIds":[751240114,751240117]},{"nodeId":751240114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":213236770,"text":"何の意味があるの？","nextNodeIds":[751240115]},{"nodeId":751240115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"ジョンヴェル","textMapHash":1562939266,"text":"意味がないというところに意味があるのです。自力で水に浮かべるのに、浮き輪をするというのは…","nextNodeIds":[751240116]},{"nodeId":751240116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"ジョンヴェル","textMapHash":1502614586,"text":"モラでモラを稼ぐのと同じように無意味なことなんです！","nextNodeIds":[751240120]},{"nodeId":751240120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":929877042,"text":"浮流ペンギンに重荷を背負わせてるぞ…","nextNodeIds":[751240121]},{"nodeId":751240121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"ジョンヴェル","textMapHash":742844738,"text":"これこそが「超現実的撮影」——つまり、写真からより深い意味を見出すという手法なんです…ですが、ちょっとしたトラブルに見舞われておりまして。","nextNodeIds":[751240122]},{"nodeId":751240122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"ジョンヴェル","textMapHash":3395428434,"text":"実際の浮流ペンギンに浮き輪をする習慣がないので…なかなか理想の写真が撮れないんです…","nextNodeIds":[751240123]},{"nodeId":751240123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1784309914,"text":"まあ「超現実的」な撮影だからね…","nextNodeIds":[751240124]},{"nodeId":751240124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":226265242,"text":"#でも、浮流ペンギンたちに浮き輪をはめてやればいいんだろ？{NICKNAME}、浮流ペンギン愛好家のよしみてことで、手伝ってやろうぜ！","nextNodeIds":[751240125,751240127]},{"nodeId":751240125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4088317498,"text":"うん！愛好家同士、助け合おう！","nextNodeIds":[751240126]},{"nodeId":751240126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1651048210,"text":"その調子だぜ！","nextNodeIds":[751240129]},{"nodeId":751240129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"ジョンヴェル","textMapHash":1442296754,"text":"本当に手伝ってくださるのですか？","nextNodeIds":[751240130]},{"nodeId":751240130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3036700642,"text":"へへっ、報酬はいい写真何枚かでいいぜ！","nextNodeIds":[751240131]},{"nodeId":751240131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"ジョンヴェル","textMapHash":893138154,"text":"で、ではぜひお願いします！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":751240127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3706891554,"text":"やっぱり、フライングモモンガのほうが好き…","nextNodeIds":[751240128]},{"nodeId":751240128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":617668898,"text":"もう、今は言うなって！","nextNodeIds":[751240129]},{"nodeId":751240117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2454202138,"text":"確かに珍しいアイデアだね…","nextNodeIds":[751240118]},{"nodeId":751240118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"ジョンヴェル","textMapHash":3619003482,"text":"自力で浮かべる浮流ペンギンが、浮き輪をはめているという構図は、意味の重なりが過剰なのです。","nextNodeIds":[751240119]},{"nodeId":751240119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21732,"speakerName":"ジョンヴェル","textMapHash":838377978,"text":"それによって、「過剰消費」や「浪費」といったテーマを表すことができるのです…","nextNodeIds":[751240120]},{"nodeId":751240107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1828202546,"text":"実はフライングモモンガのほうが好き…","nextNodeIds":[751240108]},{"nodeId":751240108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1225883914,"text":"そりゃ、フライングモモンガも可愛いぞ。でも浮流ペンギンたちの目の前で、そんなこと言うなんてかわいそうだぞ！","nextNodeIds":[751240109]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7512401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP